<section class="ex-note" id="overview">
<h2>1. Overview &amp; Classification（皮膚腺體總論與分類）</h2>
<p>皮膚腺體都是 exocrine glands，由 secretory compartment（gland 或 coil）與 excretory duct 組成；腺細胞為 epithelial origin，但分泌部位於真皮不同深度。<span class="ex-ref">p.70</span></p>
<table class="ex-table">
<thead><tr><th scope="col">分類依據</th><th scope="col">Sebaceous glands</th><th scope="col">Eccrine sweat glands</th><th scope="col">Apocrine sweat glands</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Product（產物）</td><td>Sebum</td><td>Sweat</td><td>Sweat</td></tr>
<tr><td>Secretory function（分泌方式）</td><td><strong>Holocrine</strong>：完全分化的細胞破裂，連細胞質與細胞膜一起釋出</td><td><strong>Merocrine</strong>：以 exocytosis 釋出</td><td><strong>Merocrine</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td>Duct 開口</td><td>多數開口於 hair follicle canal</td><td>直接開口於皮膚表面</td><td>開口於 hair follicle canal</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="ex-cite">p.70。</p>
